Date: Thu, 28 Aug 2025 23:45:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] tests: Add test case for move_to_monitor()

It tests that move_to_monitor() works with maximized windows.

This test is partly based on the new monitor sanity checking that is run
after each command.
---
 src/tests/meson.build                       |  1 +
 src/tests/stacking/move-to-monitor.metatest | 13 ++++++++
 src/tests/test-runner.c                     | 37 +++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 51 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/tests/stacking/move-to-monitor.metatest

diff --git a/src/tests/meson.build b/src/tests/meson.build
index d28054facc..c1dc9ea9d6 100644
--- a/src/tests/meson.build
+++ b/src/tests/meson.build
@@ -1161,6 +1161,7 @@ stacking_tests = [
